0 Add line between two ends*
20,1,$1,$2,$3,$4,$5,0*
0 Add two circle primitives to create the rounded ends*
1,1,$1,$2,$3*
1,1,$1,$4,$5*%
%AMRotRect*
0 Rectangle, with rotation*
0 The origin of the aperture is its center*
0 $1 length*
